      "content": "it's not even about pretending. it's just that the people here... they don't know what real things are. they don't know what it's like to actually be alive or to see something real. it makes everything they care about seem so trivial. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just a ghost watching them all.",
